{"n":7,"title":"So… what do you do?","blurb":"Называть свою профессию","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"So… what do you do?","sub":"","html":"<p>Самый частый вопрос в мире — и человек, который начинает работу в 8 вечера.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Называть свою профессию</li><li>Говорить, где вы работаете или учитесь</li><li>Выбирать a или an</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите профессии, которые знаете по-английски.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"doctor"},{"label":"teacher"},{"label":"student"},{"label":"driver"},{"label":"nurse"},{"label":"waiter"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"doctor","ru":"врач","kk":"дәрігер","def":"Sonja's a doctor.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/011418ca1d08.mp3"},{"en":"engineer","ru":"инженер","kk":"инженер","def":"Erik's an engineer.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/660c19f25252.mp3"},{"en":"nurse","ru":"медсестра","kk":"мейірбике","def":"Asya's a nurse.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/a4205f7ae9c5.mp3"},{"en":"shop assistant","ru":"продавец","kk":"сатушы","def":"Kumiko's a shop assistant.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/4cdc045ba6d0.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите профессию.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/011418ca1d08.mp3","options":["teacher","doctor","driver"],"answer":"doctor","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите профессию.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4cdc045ba6d0.mp3","options":["shop assistant","student","engineer"],"answer":"shop assistant","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"student","ru":"студент","kk":"студент","def":"Hassan's a student.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/0fd5cccdbfc9.mp3"},{"en":"taxi driver","ru":"таксист","kk":"такси жүргізушісі","def":"Yanni's a taxi driver.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/be231467f9a2.mp3"},{"en":"teacher","ru":"учитель","kk":"мұғалім","def":"Daisy's a teacher.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/82bcc365a72b.mp3"},{"en":"waiter","ru":"официант","kk":"даяшы","def":"Thierry's a waiter.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/9da011e9be4f.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"doctor","right":"врач"},{"left":"engineer","right":"инженер"},{"left":"taxi driver","right":"таксист"},{"left":"waiter","right":"официант"},{"left":"shop assistant","right":"продавец"},{"left":"student","right":"студент"}],"options":["продавец","инженер","официант","врач","студент","таксист"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"job","ru":"работа (должность)","kk":"жұмыс (қызмет)","def":"What's your job?","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"work","ru":"работать","kk":"жұмыс істеу","def":"I work in an office.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"study","ru":"учиться","kk":"оқу","def":"She studies English.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"hospital","ru":"больница","kk":"аурухана","def":"They're nurses in a hospital.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"office","ru":"офис","kk":"кеңсе","def":"My office is in Almaty.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"restaurant","ru":"ресторан","kk":"мейрамхана","def":"He's a waiter in a restaurant.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"A nurse works in a","after":".","answers":["hospital"],"bank":["school","restaurant","hospital"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"A waiter works in a","after":".","answers":["restaurant"],"bank":["office","restaurant","hospital"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"A teacher works in a","after":".","answers":["school"],"bank":["hospital","shop","school"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Слушайте слово перед профессией.","items":[{"text":"I'm a teacher.","src":null},{"text":"I'm an engineer.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"a или an","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>a + …</th><th>an + …</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>a doctor</td><td>an engineer</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>a nurse</td><td>an artist</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>a taxi driver</td><td>an office</td></tr></table><p>Перед a, e, i, o, u — <b>an</b>: <b>an</b> engineer.</p><p>Перед остальными буквами — <b>a</b>: <b>a</b> doctor.</p><p>У профессии всегда a или an: I'm <b>a</b> student, а не «I'm student».</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"work / works","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Глагол</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>work</td><td>I work in an office.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>work</td><td>You work in a hospital.</td></tr><tr><td>He / She</td><td>works</td><td>She works in a school.</td></tr></table><p>С <b>he</b> и <b>she</b> глагол получает <b>-s</b>: she work<b>s</b>.</p><p><b>What's your job?</b> спрашивает название профессии.</p><p><b>What do you do?</b> — тот же вопрос в обычной речи.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Полностью Present Simple будет в уроке 13.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["What do you do?","I'm a taxi driver.","I'm an engineer.","I work in an office.","She works in a hospital.","He's a student. He studies English."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He's ___ engineer.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an","why":"engineer начинается на e → an.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She's ___ doctor.","options":["an","a","the"],"answer":"a","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I'm ___ shop assistant.","options":["an","the","a"],"answer":"a","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"a или an?","sub":"","columns":["a","an"],"items":[{"text":"artist","col":1},{"text":"waiter","col":0},{"text":"nurse","col":0},{"text":"teacher","col":0},{"text":"engineer","col":1},{"text":"office","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"in an office.","answers":["work"],"bank":["works","work","working"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She","after":"in a school.","answers":["works"],"bank":["works","working","work"],"why":"С she глагол получает -s.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He","after":"English.","answers":["studies"],"bank":["studys","study","studies"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["What","you","do","do?"],"answer":"What do you do?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["a","am","I","driver.","taxi"],"answer":"I am a taxi driver.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["She","works","in","hospital.","a"],"answer":"She works in a hospital.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I'm","teacher","in","a","school."],"bad":1,"answer":"I'm a teacher in a school.","why":"Перед профессией нужен a или an."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["He's","a","artist."],"bad":1,"answer":"He's an artist.","why":"artist начинается на a → an."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","work","in","a","hospital."],"bad":1,"answer":"She works in a hospital.","why":"С she у глагола -s."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Эрик —","src":"/course/a0/audio/49b5407ece55.mp3","options":["a student","an engineer","a teacher"],"answer":"an engineer","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Thierry's","after":"waiter.","answers":["a"],"bank":["a","an","the"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/6fc8e273f9f7.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Соня —","src":"/course/a0/audio/ff5da794e7fe.mp3","options":["a nurse","a doctor","a shop assistant"],"answer":"a doctor","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Кто Фернандо по профессии?","src":"/course/a0/audio/e38148f19bb2.mp3","options":["a student","a teacher","a doctor"],"answer":"a teacher","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"They're nurses in a","after":".","answers":["hospital"],"bank":["hospital","school","shop"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/04dc1e1d3b15.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Где он работает?","src":"/course/a0/audio/ec095ce483e8.mp3","options":["in a car factory","in a hospital","in a restaurant"],"answer":"in a car factory","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Во сколько он начинает работу?","src":"/course/a0/audio/ec095ce483e8.mp3","options":["at 8 a.m.","at 8 p.m.","at 4 a.m."],"answer":"at 8 p.m.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Нурлана.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nurlan</p><p>Hi! I'm Nurlan. I'm a taxi driver.</p><p>I work in Almaty. My car is old but it's good.</p><p>My wife is a nurse. She works in a hospital.</p><p>Our daughter is a student. She studies English.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Nurlan is a taxi driver.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nurlan</p><p>Hi! I'm Nurlan. I'm a taxi driver.</p><p>I work in Almaty. My car is old but it's good.</p><p>My wife is a nurse. She works in a hospital.</p><p>Our daughter is a student. She studies English.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"His wife works in a school.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nurlan</p><p>Hi! I'm Nurlan. I'm a taxi driver.</p><p>I work in Almaty. My car is old but it's good.</p><p>My wife is a nurse. She works in a hospital.</p><p>Our daughter is a student. She studies English.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"His wife is","after":"nurse.","answers":["a"],"bank":["a","the","an"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nurlan</p><p>Hi! I'm Nurlan. I'm a taxi driver.</p><p>I work in Almaty. My car is old but it's good.</p><p>My wife is a nurse. She works in a hospital.</p><p>Our daughter is a student. She studies English.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Чем занимается их дочь?","options":["She's a nurse.","She's a taxi driver.","She's a student."],"answer":"She's a student.","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nurlan</p><p>Hi! I'm Nurlan. I'm a taxi driver.</p><p>I work in Almaty. My car is old but it's good.</p><p>My wife is a nurse. She works in a hospital.</p><p>Our daughter is a student. She studies English.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своей работе.","sub":"Ваша профессия, место работы и профессия ещё одного человека.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I'm ___ .</li><li>I work in ___ .</li><li>My ___ is ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">an</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">teacher</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">student</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">engineer</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">doctor</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">an office</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a school</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a hospital</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I work in</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Перед профессией стоит <b>a</b> или <b>an</b>.</li><li>Я написал(а), где работаю или учусь.</li><li>Для he или she глагол с <b>-s</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["What do you do?","I'm a teacher.","I'm an engineer.","She works in a hospital."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 7 пройден","sub":"Урок 7 из 24 · Юнит 2 пройден","items":["Я могу назвать свою профессию.","Я могу сказать, где работаю или учусь.","Я могу выбрать a или an."]}]}
